Firefox Native Tab Search is a standalone reimplementation of the native
vertical-tabs search integration from TabSearch by Mike Irvin.

Original project: https://github.com/irvinm/TabSearch
Original license: MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Mike Irvin

The standalone version removes the WebExtension dependency: the search field,
matching logic and tab visibility handling are implemented directly in a
privileged Autoconfig chrome script. The matching and visibility-plan rules
are derived from TabSearch's native filter.
